{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3EmUX8uGGDB2xo3gyMFllg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:42.840101+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3EmUX8uGGDB2xo3gyMFllg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM4tDYZejdecJssvkRjRialIHtx9rfslY5dtcV1BMKyFdQcYTC3GPhEnpuo62QianXZbB1aPBEichkdBY0tEI4lA4346G2VeO2ueS1SbR6CibA8ltw/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>“农脉传薪：中国农业遗产与科技文明”南京农业大学科学技术史2026年第六届暑期学校，计划于</span><strong><span>2026年8月19日至8月22日</span></strong><span>在南京农业大学（卫岗校区）举行。为开阔研究生和优秀本科生的学术视野，增进学术交流，现面向国内各大高校、研究所相关专业的优秀本科生、研究生招收学员。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、学科点简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京农业大学坐落于钟灵毓秀、虎踞龙蟠的古都南京，是一所以农业和生命科学为优势和特色，农、理、经、管、工、文、法学多学科协调发展的教育部直属全国重点大学，是国家“211工程”重点建设大学、“985优势学科创新平台”和“双一流”建设高校。</span></p><p><span>南京农业大学科学技术史学科点最早可追溯到1920年在金陵大学筹建的农业图书研究部。1955年在周恩来总理的亲自关怀下，农业部批准在南京中山门外设立中国农业遗产研究室，万国鼎担任首任主任，2001年更名为中华农业文明研究院（2000 年科学技术史系成立）。现有专任教师18位，其中教授9位、副教授5位，博士生导师9位（含兼职）、硕士生导师13位，省部级人才5位。</span></p><p><span>学科点分别于1981年、1986年、1992年被批准设立硕士、博士学位授权点与博士后流动站，相继被评为国家农业部重点学科、江苏省重点学科、江苏省高校哲学社会科学重点研究基地。2021年，获批文化遗产本科专业（历史学），并连续五年获得历史学软科“A+”，现已形成本科-硕士-博士-博士后流动站完善的人才培养体系。农业史一直是我系最具优势和特色的核心研究方向，农业文化遗产保护、农业文献整理与数字化研究长期处于国内外领先地位。近年来，农业考古、科技与社会成为新的学术增长点。</span></p><p><span>科学技术史学科点在百年办学实践中，既有万国鼎、缪启愉、李长年、郭文韬、王思明等一批农史学家，更有一批年富力强并在学界具有一定影响力的中青年学人，多人获批省部级人才项目，是国内公认的农史研究重镇，在探索农史研究体系及其教育模式方面发挥了重要作用。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk4M4P92tCyvYbhnYMQhGUYDUKULO0pIl2niaLVYLEj155G7Vzd8XnVibKpfgua2ARQ2cNRWVG9r5lFqjLgEz4tSwjnWzt6Zw8jqo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk6jVFn9gWHaWr8DaQLXEictNfOaBXEcBeqq3oNlPyBDibHXZfXOa3030FQ3Jk6CKW6TnHOLozqibzTMbDjDpFW4gM5FA4BQxazp60/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk5VNqwjeOVH4HfNKm3EsavLK0ibSoZSk44e5AoL23ibwibqU5ibnKJJHYW0ibtYlo8HHGPSFM4PZmwUPhuARJYgibgibcwD6c616kMRIQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk7wUYCIDx3Au1mGs9ACRbZtj69TdRbUCGvPketp5JE31y51PA13ibaVJFIw7o7HKjJujoudXk0ic9QTLQkic7j8G1wMzjO85vzc1M/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk5YL9M5SRukrsib2ut2ZEr4EhQNyRGaHuB8jPnbPsdIR2aTpsjMgBzUcPl2WyHCuoVnt6POdt7j4BjQoLSU7clUQiaPxOgxqrqr4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk4hhQhH1vMECsnTfyd7mKOITDV8kVHRBkYeFq3Jex49E6pWtXlpzIqwyNwmIB5Q79StbW1scnE5ial7ichrHYq2o9nApb0vLc0Vc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk7dn1t3u9yQaQ1MADIv5K2KTPT5Q6iaWjiaibxZOaEo0ZwI1YpWdISwuuTk8xJib25yLCoibgyO7LY0PXAWn6XXiblXltK9QwYXIkwt0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk6ricicWecC0icm881QzERghibwH0HvqF0RH1nAjeQw2yibSYkntMgDPbuSgqSAWh3uvhCTfj2pQ8micBTZVQuIBKRDxVGdiaHDOO44eg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生计划</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>暑期学校计划面向全国各高校及其研究所的优秀大三、大四的本科生、硕士生。学员需提供个人申请表、学生证复印件、个人学术自述等材料，由暑期学校领导小组根据材料对推荐学生进行筛选，确定为正式学员。</span><strong><span>最终选拔25名左右学生参加本次暑期学校。</span><span><span>本次暑期学校不收取任何费用，涉及收费即为诈骗。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>举办时间：2026年8月19日至8月22日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>举办地点：南京农业大学卫岗校区</span></strong></p><p><span>主题报告具体安排时间2026年8月11日左右公布。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；热爱学术研究，尤其是对农业史领域研究具有浓厚的兴趣。</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优异。具有科学技术史、历史学、农学、民族学、人类学等相关学科背景的全日制在校优秀本科学生（2027届毕业）、硕士研究生优先。</span></p><p><span>3.英语水平良好。获得CET4（450分以上）CET6(425分以上)或更高水平的证书，在读期间以第一作者（或导师一作，学生二作）发表过论文者优先。</span></p><p><span>4.身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>本次暑期学校申请一律提交电子版</span></strong><span>，请申请者确保提交的材料和信息真实准确，一经发现弄虚作假，将当即取消资格。</span></p><p><span>1.个人学术简历1份，其中包含个人基本信息、教育背景、课程学习、学术经历、学术成果、所获荣誉、社会实践、学习研究计划等；</span></p><p><span>2.英语水平测试成绩单，如CET/TOEFL/IELTS/GRE/GMAT等成绩单（扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>3.科研成果证明材料，已发表论文需提交期刊封面、目录、论文全文电子版或扫描件，获奖或资格证书需提交证书扫描件。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名截止日期：</span><strong><span>2026年8月9日24点</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.电子材料发送到电子邮箱：</span></p><p><strong><span>wh2018018@njau.edu.cn</span></strong><span>（吴老师），</span><strong><span>邮件主题及附件命名为“姓名+所在学校、专业+2026年南农暑期学校申请”</span></strong><span>。收到确认邮件后，视为申请材料提交成功。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、审核选拔</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>审核和选拔工作由“农脉传薪：中国农业遗产与科技文明”南京农业大学科学技术史2026年第六届暑期学校领导小组负责。选拔工作将于2026年8月11日结束，入选学生名单将在人文与社会发展学院网站（http://xrw.njau.edu.cn/）、农业文明网（http://www.icac.edu.cn/）和农史研究资讯微信公众号上公布，并通过电话或电子邮件形式直接通知本人，未接到入选通知的同学即为未入选者，不再另行通知。候选人需在获得通知后2天内回复邮件确认是否参加，逾期未回复邮件者视为放弃参营资格，缺额将从候补名单中依次替补。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、学员待遇</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.免费发放教材、讲义等学习资料；学员学习结束时，将颁发结业证书。</span></p><p><span>2.学科点提供暑期学校期间的学员用餐，住宿和往返交通由学员自理。</span></p><p><span>3.暑期学校结束后，每位学生在规定时间内提交一份学习报告，并根据课程参与学习情况和总结交流表现，评选6-8位优秀学员，并颁发优秀学员证书。</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>八、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>如有疑问，请联系吴老师进行咨询。</span></p><p><span>E-mail: wh2018018@njau.edu.cn </span></p><p><span>电话：17368732750</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>南京农业大学人文与社会发展学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>南京农业大学中华农业文明研究院</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM4o6hibtcerHW4lblTODyartskdvgynYmIqWYMicmdgBbFA0WwRfniauibyF6nm5mnQwG45lbQ0T8mSWpLmicSRVA7KNvuI1alaG5SzRc4TsiajPibSA/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rx0URfU7lk6qa3Q71jmyera2PCAGSpnD1NicUmdEYIaFSw8QOlibS6AMAXdklI0ug93kYGq1z67CNDicaeSTVYUnVd6VMzpgWrg5ajybTJ4Z6o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>扫码关注</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"16553c85c655ee44830b992f8938d35636ac8857a67ad947729ddf579df546f2","textLength":2080,"sourceSha256":"a040ee1f2b0a68cf3f04c428eaad1f6ad5951e585dc3eaa0dddad2e5ca0fe37e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4d1d600ffdb3407ed3c2","title":"2026年南京农业大学人文与社会发展学院“农脉传薪：中国农业遗产与科技文明”科学技术史2026年第六届暑期学校招募通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:42.840101+00:00"}
